@startuml
state Shut_Down_State [*]
state Running_State
state Configuration_Mode
state Controlled_Mode
state Shut_Down_State_Final

[*] -- Power_On/Off > Running_State: Power On/Off
Running_State -- Configuration_Request > Configuration_Mode: Configuration Request
Configuration_Mode -- Configuration_Completion > Running_State: Configuration Completion
Running_State -- Clock_Trigger : Clock Trigger
Running_State -- Weather_Summary_Request > Weather_Summary: Weather Summary Request
Running_State -- Status_Check_Request > Status_Check: Status Check Request
Running_State -- Remote_Control_Command > Controlled_Mode: Remote Control Command
Controlled_Mode -- Shutdown_Command > Shut_Down_State_Final: Shutdown Command
Weather_Summary -- Prepare_and_Send_Weather_Summary > Running_State: Prepare and Send Weather Summary
Status_Check -- Check_Own_Status_Transmit_Result > Running_State: Check Own Status and Transmit Result
Controlled_Mode -- Control_Released > Running_State: After Control is Released

@enduml
